{"2063480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voltage High Society", "steam_appid": 2063480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're sentenced to Nemo Ultra, a decaying prison island infested with cybernetic horrors. Learn what it means to survive in your new home. Explore the vast island and discover bizarre tools to help you press deeper. Meat obeys metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voltage High Society is a gritty first-person cyberpunk metroidvania. Locked doors, ability gates, backtracking, shortcuts, secrets, and boss fights test everything you've learned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/66ce9bf506107c8aa7caff8b71fa49b0.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/66ce9bf506107c8aa7caff8b71fa49b0.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/66ce9bf506107c8aa7caff8b71fa49b0.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARVE A PATH WITH YOUR FISTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hand fights on its own in aggressive close-quarters combat. Throw punches with either fist, or arm one hand — or both — with the weapons and tools you discover. Choose the correct hand for the job by reading your enemies for an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/d83830275b1986aa6cdeb16fa8fae8b5.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/d83830275b1986aa6cdeb16fa8fae8b5.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/d83830275b1986aa6cdeb16fa8fae8b5.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/f1ae037b8dac9f8cde9d3b181ebbf575.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/f1ae037b8dac9f8cde9d3b181ebbf575.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/f1ae037b8dac9f8cde9d3b181ebbf575.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUTATE TO MAKE IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the island's virulent metal plague to survive and thrive on Nemo Ultra. Gain new combat moves and ways to interact with the world. Seek out the nearest lizard-run body-mod shop to get started. Veteran prisoners also whisper of mysterious rings surfacing across the island...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/2b27545cc7b9b9b9474fb3cf1a775616.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/2b27545cc7b9b9b9474fb3cf1a775616.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/2b27545cc7b9b9b9474fb3cf1a775616.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEMO ULTRA, YOUR PRISON PLAYGROUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemo Ultra is a hand-crafted, interconnected island built for exploration. Unlock new passages with your expanding toolkit and turn dead ends into shortcuts. Inspired by repeated viewings of Tetsuo: The Iron Man and Escape from New York.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO-GRIT BODY HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1-era aesthetics meet modern lighting and visual design. Dark, oppressive alleyways open into neon-drenched arenas. With its deformed inhabitants and electrified atmosphere, the world of Voltage High Society feels like a place that existed long before you arrived.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're sentenced to Nemo Ultra, a decaying prison island infested with cybernetic horrors. Learn what it means to survive in your new home. Explore the vast island and discover bizarre tools to help you press deeper. Meat obeys metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voltage High Society is a gritty first-person cyberpunk metroidvania. Locked doors, ability gates, backtracking, shortcuts, secrets, and boss fights test everything you've learned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/66ce9bf506107c8aa7caff8b71fa49b0.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/66ce9bf506107c8aa7caff8b71fa49b0.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/66ce9bf506107c8aa7caff8b71fa49b0.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARVE A PATH WITH YOUR FISTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hand fights on its own in aggressive close-quarters combat. Throw punches with either fist, or arm one hand — or both — with the weapons and tools you discover. Choose the correct hand for the job by reading your enemies for an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/d83830275b1986aa6cdeb16fa8fae8b5.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/d83830275b1986aa6cdeb16fa8fae8b5.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/d83830275b1986aa6cdeb16fa8fae8b5.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/f1ae037b8dac9f8cde9d3b181ebbf575.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/f1ae037b8dac9f8cde9d3b181ebbf575.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/f1ae037b8dac9f8cde9d3b181ebbf575.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUTATE TO MAKE IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the island's virulent metal plague to survive and thrive on Nemo Ultra. Gain new combat moves and ways to interact with the world. Seek out the nearest lizard-run body-mod shop to get started. Veteran prisoners also whisper of mysterious rings surfacing across the island...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/2b27545cc7b9b9b9474fb3cf1a775616.poster.avif?t=1787569763\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/2b27545cc7b9b9b9474fb3cf1a775616.webm?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063480/extras/2b27545cc7b9b9b9474fb3cf1a775616.mp4?t=1787569763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEMO ULTRA, YOUR PRISON PLAYGROUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemo Ultra is a hand-crafted, interconnected island built for exploration. Unlock new passages with your expanding toolkit and turn dead ends into shortcuts. Inspired by repeated viewings of Tetsuo: The Iron Man and Escape from New York.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO-GRIT BODY HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PS1-era aesthetics meet modern lighting and visual design. Dark, oppressive alleyways open into neon-drenched arenas. With its deformed inhabitants and electrified atmosphere, the world of Voltage High Society feels like a place that existed long before you arrived.</p>", "short_description": "First-person horror metroidvania about fisting your way through a prison island crawling with cybernetic monstrosities. Explore, evolve, escape. Inspired by Tetsuo: The Iron Man.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Overall, Voltage High Society is an immersive first-person Metroidvania game that offers a unique and engaging experience.”<br>3rd Strike (EA Preview)<br><br>“...the level design and incredible atmosphere – think dystopian cyberpunk by way of Silent Hill – feels novel and worth supporting.”<br>Gameblur (EA Preview)<br><br>“Platonic Partnership has succeeded in blending the brutality of a first-person brawler with the thoughtful exploration of a Metroidvania, bui